        },
        "description": "The protagonist of Your Forma. Echika is the youngest electronic investigator in the world and a standout talent when it comes to Brain Diving, so much so that her dives often cause her partners to suffer brain-related injuries whilst connected to her. This issue has lead to her being partnered with [Harold W. Lucraft](https://anilist.co/character/213705/Harold-W-Lucraft), a quick-witted and seemingly frivolous yet cutting-edge Amicus with equal skills to her.\n\n",
