        },
        "description": "__Manufacture Date:__ Jan 9, 2015\n\nThe deuteragonist of Your Forma. Harold is a cutting-edge Amicus and an electronic investigator aide. He is the partner of [Echika Hieda](https://anilist.co/character/213704/Echika-Hieda), whom he frequently quips with and teases in an attempt to have her open up to him. While he often acts casually and flippantly he has incredible talents at deduction and reasoning, planning his every move many steps ahead.\n",
