        },
        "description": "A Sami girl who lives in Kautokeino, a technologically-restricted zone in Norway. She is a skilled bio-hacker who becomes acquaintances with [Harold](https://anilist.co/character/213705/Harold-W-Lucraft) and [Echika](https://anilist.co/character/213704/Echika-Hieda), having a crush on the former and disliking the latter due to the circumstances in which they met. However, they make up their differences afterwards, becoming close friends and allies.",
