        },
        "description": "A detective in the Saint Petersburg City Police's burglary-homicide department, and husband of [Darya](https://anilist.co/character/324327/Darya-R-Tchernova).\n\nSozon brought [Harold](https://anilist.co/character/213705/Harold-W-Lucraft) to his home after discovering him abandoned in an alley and quickly came to accept him as family. Taught Harold his rare deductive skills after taking him on as a partner.\n\n~!He was murdered during the Nightmare of Saint Petersburg incident.!~",
